僕はもう9歳...9歳になったロボさ、ここまで成長を見届けてくれてありがとうね！
I've already turned 9... Robosa, who has turned 9, thank you so much for watching over my growth up to now!

546
01:01:16,414 --> 01:01:24,494
これからもまだまだ僕は成長していくので、一緒に長く楽しんでいきましょう！
I'm going to keep growing even more from now on, so let's continue to enjoy it together for a long time!

547
01:01:25,334 --> 01:01:41,514
最後の曲は...初めにちらっていったけど...ドラゴンくんに乗りたいな！一緒に頑張ってくれる？ねえ、ドラゴンくん！
The last song... I briefly mentioned it at the beginning, but... I want to ride dragon-kun! Will you do your best together with me? Hey, dragon-kun!

548
01:01:56,658 --> 01:02:03,738
[Title: DAN DAN 心魅かれてく]
DAN DAN 心魅かれてく その眩しい笑顔に
[Title: DAN DAN Kokoro Hikareteku]
Slowly, my heart is drawn to your dazzling smile

549
01:02:04,198 --> 01:02:09,018
果てない暗闇から飛び出そう Hold my hand
Let's leap out from the endless darkness, hold my hand

550
01:02:18,678 --> 01:02:31,198
君と出合ったとき 子供の頃大切に想っていた景色を思い出したんだ
When I met you, I remembered the scenery I cherished so much when I was a child

551
01:02:32,318 --> 01:02:40,178
僕と踊ってくれないか 光と影の Winding Road
Won't you dance with me on the winding road of light and shadow?

552
01:02:40,678 --> 01:02:45,558
今でも あいつに夢中なの？ 少しだけ 振り向きたくなるような
Are you still obsessed with that guy? Even during moments when I want to make you look back just a little,

553
01:02:50,238 --> 01:02:58,198
愛と勇気と誇りを持って闘うよ
I'll fight with love, courage, and pride!

554
01:03:01,578 --> 01:03:08,778
DAN DAN 心魅かれてく この宇宙の希望のかけら
Slowly, my heart is drawn to this fragment of hope in the universe

555
01:03:09,358 --> 01:03:15,378
きっと誰もが 永遠を手に入れたい
Surely everyone wants to obtain eternity

556
01:03:15,618 --> 01:03:22,758
全然気にしないふりしても ほら 君に恋してる
Even if I pretend not to care at all, look, I'm in love with you

557
01:03:23,538 --> 01:03:29,878
果てない暗闇から飛び出そう Hold your hand
Let's leap out from the endless darkness, hold your hand

558
01:04:00,138 --> 01:04:05,438
怒った顔も疲れてる 君も好きだけど あんなに
I like you even when you look angry or tired, but

559
01:04:05,998 --> 01:04:12,858
飛ばして生きて 大丈夫かなと思う
I wonder if it's really okay to live life speeding along like that

560
01:04:13,378 --> 01:04:21,158
僕は 何気ない行動に 振り回されてる sea side blue
I get tossed around by your casual actions on the seaside blue

561
01:04:21,778 --> 01:04:27,958
それでも あいつに夢中なの？ もっと聞きたい事があったのに
Even so, are you still obsessed with that guy? Even though there were more things I wanted to ask,

562
01:04:28,238 --> 01:04:41,538
二人の会話が 車の音にはばまれて通りに舞うよ
our conversation was drowned out by the sound of cars and danced away into the street

563
01:04:42,398 --> 01:04:49,918
DAN DAN 心魅かれてく 自分でも 不思議なんだけど
Slowly, my heart is drawn to you, which is strange even to myself

564
01:04:50,298 --> 01:04:56,778
何があると一番に 君に電話したくなる
Whenever something happens, I immediately want to call you first

565
01:04:57,138 --> 01:05:00,157
全然気のないフリしても
Even if I pretend not to care at all

566
01:05:00,556 --> 01:05:03,628
結局 君のことだけ見ていた
I was only looking at you all along...

567
01:05:09,378 --> 01:05:12,128
海の彼方へ 飛び出そうよ Hold my hand
To the other side of the sea, let's leap out! Hold my hand

568
01:05:12,278 --> 01:05:15,228
ああ...
Ah...

569
01:05:33,505 --> 01:05:36,385
みんなー！ロボさー！
Everyone! Robosa!

570
01:05:36,855 --> 01:05:39,705
今日は見てくれてありがとー！
Thank you so much for watching today!

571
01:05:40,095 --> 01:05:45,085
このあともなんと！メンバー限定で歌いまーす！
And after this, guess what! I'll be singing exclusively for members!

572
01:05:45,585 --> 01:05:50,278
遊びに来てねー！
Come hang out with me!

573
01:05:50,278 --> 01:05:55,115
グッズもめっちゃ可愛いからゲットしてくれよなー！
The merch is super cute too, so make sure to grab some!

574
01:05:56,305 --> 01:05:59,035
ばいばーい！
Bye-bye!

